\fs16\par
The campaign follows a civilization from its rise to its exodus. The Clonks found towns in the Teudoburg Forest, conquer the dizzying heights of Dirol and discover ancient artifacts. They are driven by their longing for prosperity, but even more by their fear that their planet will perish.\par
